  "description": "A SID-style voice written from scratch: saw, triangle, pulse with a width and a built-in PWM LFO, 23-bit noise, four combined waves, a modulator oscillator for hard sync and ring modulation, the stepped attack / decay / sustain / release of the Commodore 64 table, a three-step arpeggio, a pitch sweep and a vibrato. A zero-delay-feedback state-variable filter (eight modes, resonance, a cutoff curve per model, key tracking, envelope amount and a level-compensated drive). One mono voice an instance.",
